10→/**
11→ * Secondary index for vector nearest-neighbour search on a float array field. Wraps
12→ * {@code LsmVectorIndex} (IvfFlat or Hnsw) from jlsm-vector.
13→ *
14→ * <p>
15→ * Contract:
16→ * <ul>
17→ * <li>Supports: VectorNearest predicate only</li>
18→ * <li>The indexed field must be an ArrayType with FLOAT32 or FLOAT16 element type</li>
19→ * <li>On insert: extracts the float array from the document and inserts into the vector index</li>
20→ * <li>On update: removes old vector, inserts new vector</li>
21→ * <li>On delete: removes the vector from the index</li>
22→ * <li>Caller chooses IvfFlat or Hnsw algorithm at table build time</li>
23→ * </ul>
24→ *
25→ * <p>
